            <ArticleTitle>An unusual case of mixed sclerosing bone dystrophy presenting with morning stiffness and joint swelling in childhood: a case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>525-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe a case of a 16 year old native Indian girl with pain, morning stiffness and foot swelling who had radiographic changes consistent with mixed sclerosing bone dystrophy (MSBD) combined with fibrous dysplasia.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
